        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SPBDB478, ANSI Blank Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nANSI Blank Strike Plate. Normally used on commercial metal frame doors to cover the frame hole when a <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device</b></a> is used on the door. Available in 7 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-L.D12012-installed.gif?v=1704354498\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ANSI Blank Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/ansi-strike-plate-deltana-span478\"><b>Standard ANSI  Strike Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SPBDB478 ANSI Blank Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width to Lip: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Total Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SPBDB478.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>DEL-SPBDB478 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
